  "id": "rebel-clash-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Rebel Clash Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Rebel Clash prerelease tournaments of April 2020 were canceled because of the COVID-19 pandemic, so shops in the Prerelease Program sold the boxes from 18 April 2020, before a wider release on 1 May. Each box held four Rebel Clash booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Rebel Clash logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Luxray and Grimmsnarl, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Sword & Shield's non-holo Professor's Research, first found in that expansion's box.",
